    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d43">

                <pb facs="0069" n="51" sameAs="frus:frus1948v03/pg51"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">857.20/3–1248: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Embassy in Norway </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">top secret</hi>
                        <lb/>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">us urgent</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1948-03-12T19:00:00-05:00">March 12, 1948—7
                            p. m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>107. Urtels 143 Mar 11, 6 p. m. and 146 Mar 12, noon. You may inform FonMin we
                    are giving most urgent consideration to question of Norwegian security. If
                    Soviet demands are made on Norway, in our opinion it is imperative that Norway
                    adamantly resist such demands and pressure. Events in Czecho and elsewhere
                    demonstrate futility of any other course. Soviet demands on Turkey and Iran were
                    resolutely and successfully resisted by those countries. The American Govt
                    supported both Turkey and Iran in resisting the Soviet demands.</p>
                <p>You may tell FonMin in absolute confidence that we are in communication with Brit
                    Govt about Norwegian situation. You should confer with your Brit colleague about
                    advisability of correlating your talks <pb facs="0070" n="52" xml:id="pg52"/>
                    with FonMin with those of BritAmb who I am sure wall have received instructions
                    along this same line.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Marshall</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
